# "When The Master of Lake-town dies, draw a card for each graveyard with seven or more cards in it." Bot1's two Lightning Bolts
# (Black Lotus's {R}{R}{R}) take Bot2 from 20 to 14 and the Master mills six of Bot2's cards; on turn 2 Bot2's own Bolt kills the
# Master, and that Bolt makes Bot2's graveyard exactly seven. Counted as the ability resolves, it is the one graveyard of seven
# (Bot1's holds four: Lotus, two Bolts and the Master), so Bot1 draws one card - exactly one.

